BEGIN_PGML
Use logarithmic differentiation to find [`\lz{y}{x}\text{,}`] then find the equation of the tangent line at the indicated [`x`]-value.

[`y=(2x)^{x^2}`] at [`x=1`]

[@KeyboardInstructions('Enter [`\lz{y}{x}`] here.')@]**

[_]{$dydx}{50}

[@KeyboardInstructions('Enter the equation of the tangent line here.')@]**

[_]{$t}{50}

[$showwork]**

END_PGML

